      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹3.14 (vs ₹2.38 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.14 (up from ₹2.38 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹202.6m (up 41% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹34.2m (up 32% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 17% (down from 18% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 3% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 1% per year.",
