      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.48 (vs ₹0.70 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.48 (down from ₹0.70 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹45.5m (up 19% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹5.28m (down 31% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 12% (down from 20% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 5% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 1% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
