      "body": "Saven Technologies Limited at the Board Meeting held on February 6, 2026, the Board of Directors of the company declared Interim dividend of INR 1.50/- (One Rupee Fifty Paisa Only) per equity share (representing 150%) on the equity share of INR l/- each fully paid up, for the financial year 2025-26. The Interim Dividend will be paid on or before March 7, 2026. The Record date for determining the eligibility of shareholders entitled to receive the interim dividend is fixed as February 16, 2026.",
